---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="O nama | Flexio Pilates & Yoga Studio Zagreb"
  description="Saznajte više o Flexio studiju, prvom certificiranom B.A.S.I. Pilates studiju u Hrvatskoj od 2007. godine. Upoznajte naše učitelje i njihova iskustva."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-pink-50 py-20">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center">
        <h1
          class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 font-display"
        >
          O nama
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Prvi certificirani B.A.S.I. Pilates studio u Hrvatskoj
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content Section -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- B.A.S.I. Pilates Info -->
      <div class="mb-20">
        <h2
          class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 font-display text-center"
        >
          B.A.S.I. Pilates Zagreb
        </h2>
        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-4xl mx-auto text-gray-700">
          <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Flexio je <strong>prvi certificirani Pilates studio u Hrvatskoj</strong>
             svjetski poznate američke škole <strong
              >B.A.S.I Pilates (Body Arts & Science International)</strong
            > koja ima suvremeni pristup originalnoj metodi Josepha Pilatesa.
          </p>
          
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6 italic text-gray-600">
            Tijelo oblikujemo, discipliniramo, poštujemo i s vremenom, počinjemo u njega imati povjerenja.
          </p>

          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Na zapadu grada, na Jarunu možete pronaći naš mali kutak za vježbanje i educiranje. U toplo uređenom prostoru pružamo Vam više od samog vježbanja – užitak, edukaciju, opuštanje i zabavu!
          </p>

          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Uz certificirane učitelje Pilatesa i Yoge sigurni smo da ćete pronaći svoje mjesto za oblikovanje tijela i uma.
          </p>

          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Nudimo razne programe vježbanja za svačiji ukus i potrebu, Power i Slow Flow Yoga, Ashtanga Yoga te vrhunski Pilates, jedinstveni u grad.
          </p>

          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
            Pilates Studio Flexio je prvi certificirani Pilates studio u Hrvatskoj svjetski poznate američke škole B.A.S.I. PILATES koja ima suvremeni pristup originalnoj metodi Joseph Pilates. Individualno pristupamo svakom klijentu i rad je maksimalno kontroliran te se radi u manjim grupama.
          </p>

          <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-flexio pl-6 my-8 italic text-2xl text-gray-700">
            "Vježbe radite s minimalnim naporom i maksimalnim užitkom."
          </blockquote>

          <p class="text-right text-gray-600 -mt-4 mb-8">
            — Joseph Pilates
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature Grid -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 lg:gap-12 mb-20">
        <!-- Since 2007 -->
        <div
          class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-pink-50"
        >
          <div
            class="w-16 h-16 bg-flexio rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 shadow-lg"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-8 h-8 text-white"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Od 2007.</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            Više od 17 godina iskustva u pružanju vrhunskih Pilates i Yoga
            programa u Zagrebu
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- B.A.S.I. Certified -->
        <div
          class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-pink-50"
        >
          <div
            class="w-16 h-16 bg-flexio rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 shadow-lg"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-8 h-8 text-white"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">
            B.A.S.I. Certificirano
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            Suvremeni pristup originalnoj metodi Josepha Pilatesa prema
            najvišim standardima
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Professional Equipment -->
        <div
          class="text-center p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-pink-50"
        >
          <div
            class="w-16 h-16 bg-flexio rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 shadow-lg"
          >
            <svg
              class="w-8 h-8 text-white"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">
            Profesionalna oprema
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            Reformer, Cadillac, Wunda Chair, Ladder Barrel, Spine Corrector
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Učitelji Section -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2
          class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-12 font-display text-center"
        >
          Učiteljica
        </h2>

        <!-- Petra Habun -->
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-pink-50 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12">
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
            <!-- Image -->
            <div class="order-2 md:order-1">
              <div class="aspect-square rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl">
                <img
                  src="/images/Petra_Habun_1.jpg"
                  alt="Petra Habun - Vlasnica Flexio Pilates & Yoga studija"
                  class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                />
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Content -->
            <div class="order-1 md:order-2">
              <h3
                class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4 font-display"
              >
                Petra Habun
              </h3>
              <p class="text-lg text-flexio font-semibold mb-4">
                Vlasnica studija<br />
                Internacionalno certificirana Pilates<br />
                &amp; Yoga učiteljica
              </p>
              <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700">
                <p>
                  <!-- Ovdje će biti tvoj sadržaj o Petri - biografija, iskustvo, obrazovanje -->
                </p>
              </div>

              <!-- Credentials -->
              <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                <span
                  class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-white text-flexio border border-purple-200"
                >
                  B.A.S.I. Pilates
                </span>
                <span
                  class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-white text-flexio border border-purple-200"
                >
                  Divya Yoga RYT 200
                </span>
                <span
                  class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm font-medium bg-white text-flexio border border-purple-200"
                >
                  Power Vinyasa Yoga
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Dodatni učitelji (ako ih ima) -->
        <!-- Ovdje možeš dodati više učitelja po potrebi -->
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-50 to-pink-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 font-display">
        Spremni za početak?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">
        Pridružite se našoj zajednici i započnite svoj wellness put danas
      </p>
      <a
        href="/kontakt"
        class="inline-block bg-flexio text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-lg font-medium hover:bg-purple-700 transition-all shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transform hover:-translate-y-1"
      >
        Rezerviraj termin
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

